    key: PS-L015
    guid: 6284c7018244ffb4a842917d2c9049f8
    legacyId: level_15
    title: Dual LED Parallel Circuit Challenge
    description: 'Build two independent LED branches in parallel from a switched
      5 V supply. Branch A uses a replaceable resistor: replace the incorrect 150
      ohm with 330 ohm in Register_Slot_2, then connect the red LED in series. Branch
      B uses a fixed 470 ohm resistor in series with a green LED; correct its polarity.
      Both LED cathodes return to supply negative. Verify both LEDs conduct, each
      branch current is within its target range, and total source current is correct.
      Switch power off before changing parts. Green LED targets depend on its configured
      forward-voltage model.'
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_15_Layout/Level_15.asset
