    guid: da56e283820aca043a09387e293bbabb
    legacyId: level_19
    title: The Loading Effect
    description: 'From a switched 5 V DC supply, build a 330 ohm TOP resistor in
      series with a parallel pair: a 470 ohm BOTTOM resistor and a 1 kohm LOAD resistor.
      Connect supply positive through the switch and TOP resistor to VOUT. Connect
      both BOTTOM and LOAD inputs to VOUT and both outputs to supply negative. Measure
      VOUT relative to negative (nominal ~2.46 V), and verify TOP, BOTTOM, LOAD and
      source currents (~7.70, ~5.24, ~2.46 and ~7.70 mA). Switch power off before
      changing connections. Verify ranges against the Project Spark solver.'
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_19_Layout/Level_19.asset
