    key: PS-L020
    guid: 3e519535634e7db4fbda3ed1044e16f6
    legacyId: level_20
    title: Wheatstone Bridge Balance
    description: 'From a switched 5 V supply, build two parallel voltage dividers:
      LEFT 330 ohm TOP and 470 ohm BOTTOM, RIGHT 330 ohm TOP and 470 ohm BOTTOM.
      The RIGHT TOP workstation initially has an incorrect 220 ohm resistor; power
      off, replace it with 330 ohm, and wire both branches to the common supply positive
      and negative. Measure the difference between MID A (left midpoint) and MID
      B (right midpoint) using LCD Terminals A and B, not a conducting wire. Balance
      requires near-zero midpoint difference, both midpoint voltages near 2.94 V,
      two branch currents near 6.25 mA, and total source current near 12.5 mA. Verify
      values against the Project Spark solver.'
    sourcePath: Assets/My_Assets/_Project_Spark/Prefabs/Levels/Chapter_02/Level_20_Layout/Level_20.asset
